# Optional. When set, /creators/ fetches the live featured-creators listing
# client-side from bharatstudio-alerts's GET /v1/public/featured, and
# scripts/generate-csp-headers.mjs widens that one route's connect-src to
# allow it. Must be an https:// origin. Leave unset to keep the honest
# "gallery goes live with the first cohort" empty state (default; safe for
# local dev and any build without a deployed, publicly reachable API).
NEXT_PUBLIC_ALERTS_API_ORIGIN=
